%%{init: {'sequence': {'noteMargin': 20}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server as Game Service
    participant Hydra
    participant Kratos

    Client->>Server: GET /auth/login
    Server-->>Client: Redirect to Hydra
    Client->>Hydra: OIDC authorization request
    Hydra-->>Client: Redirect to Kratos login
    Client->>Kratos: Login request
    Note over Client,Kratos: User authenticates
    Kratos-->>Client: Redirect back to Hydra
    Client->>Hydra: Resume authorization
    Hydra-->>Client: Redirect /auth/callback?code=...
    Client->>Server: GET /auth/callback?code=...
    Server->>Hydra: Exchange authorization code
    Hydra-->>Server: OIDC tokens
    Note over Server: Validate identity and create server-side session
    Server-->>Client: Set HttpOnly session cookie and redirect

    Client->>Server: Establish Socket.IO connection with session cookie
    alt Session valid
        Note over Server: Associate authenticated user with socket
    else Session invalid or missing
        Server-->>Client: Reject Socket.IO connection
    end
